1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Prediction apps ask whether Ether goes up or down.
OutcomeGuard turns existing exposure into bounded, verifiable protection.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Define exposure, horizon, downside scenario, premium cap,
slippage, and target protection. Structured controls remain authoritative.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:51,000
OutcomeGuard discovers DreamDEX Event Contracts on Shannon 50312,
verifies on-chain status, and reads the real order book and venue parameters.

4
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Deterministic sizing is capped and quantized by budget, depth,
price impact, spread, lot size, and portfolio limits. Basis risk remains.

5
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Every policy is visible. Unknowns fail closed.
Preview and pre-sign execution use the same policy engine.

6
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Real dedicated-test-agent evidence: bounded IOC, successful mined receipt,
decoded fill, and reconciled 4.171 NO position on Shannon.

7
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Canonical SHA-256 receipts bind intent, snapshot, math, policy,
authorization, and chain evidence. Any sealed-field change fails verification.

8
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:28,000
The market resolved DOWN. 4.171 tUSDC was redeemed,
and the winning-token position reconciled to zero.

9
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Portfolio-aware rolling protection—
policy-bound and verifiable from intent through claim.

